{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43641","headline":"春日会韩武康章後亭联句 · 清昼","name":"春日会韩武康章後亭联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後园堪寄赏，日日对春风。\n客位繁阴下，公墙细柳中。\n坐看青嶂远，心与白云同。\n林暗花烟入，池深远水通。\n井桃新长蘂，栏药未成丛。\n松竹宜禅客，山泉入谢公。\n砌香翻芍药，檐静倚梧桐。\n外虑宜帘卷，忘情与道空。\n楚僧招惠远，蜀客挹杨雄。\n便寄柴桑隐，何劳访剡东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}